{"id":"15e4c50c444f9af0","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy.md","title":"Ideal Saturation Hierarchy","display":"thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy — Ideal Saturation Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy","aliases":["58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy — Ideal Saturation Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy — Ideal Saturation Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6dd42dd522c20a30\" href=\"?note=6dd42dd522c20a30\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md\">../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(I,X,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturation\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\left[\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I\\;\\left(|\\mathcal A|=\\kappa\\to\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\land A\\cap B\\notin I)\\right)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturation\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\left[\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I\\;\\left(|\\mathcal A|=\\kappa\\to\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\land A\\cap B\\notin I)\\right)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-saturated ideal has no size-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> family of positive sets that are pairwise disjoint modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Saturated ideals have applications in forcing and cardinal invariants.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6dd42dd522c20a30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturation\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\left[\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I\\;\\left(|\\mathcal A|=\\kappa\\to\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\land A\\cap B\\notin I)\\right)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy.md|58-thm-ideal-saturation-hierarchy]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","6dd42dd522c20a30"]}